    <data key="d0">Atlassian Forge Platform Architecture</data>
    <data key="d1">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=H2fOkeXxpyw</data>
    <data key="d2">The architecture separates the core Atlassian Forge platform account from customer Lambda execution accounts using account boundaries and V8 isolates for tenant isolation.</data>
